//File:    test_params.jtext
//Date:    2026-10-30
//Purpose: Smoke matrix selection and settings for `jac313_test_cli matrix` (v002), picked with
//         --params <file>.
//
// jac313 test parameters (local matrix runner).
//
// selection: one row per package or test to include (include false leaves it out):
//   qlite, jtext, store   a package: every ctest smoke/unit in it
//   001 ... 008, flags, metric_view   a matrix stress test (ported ts_store 001-008 TS/XS + flags)
//   any other name        one ctest test, named without its path
//                         (e.g. jac313_store_binary_persist_smoke)
// settings: one row per key.
//   DISK_TYPE  auto | xssd rssd xx7k xr7k x10k r10k x15k r15k  (results layout label and the machine's disk; x = one
//              disk, r = RAID; a machine sets its own in ~/.config/jac313/disk_type or
//              JAC313_DISK_TYPE)
//   SIZE       smoke | full | bench  (smoke = default; full uses per-test scaling via
//              test_params_full.jtext; bench is test_params_bench.jtext)
//
